<messaging:emailTemplate subject="{!relatedTo.NSP_AIMS_Client_Name__c} ({!relatedTo.NSP_AIMS_ClientNo__c}) : Client has commission only employees" recipientType="User" relatedToType="Implementation_Profile__c">

<messaging:HtmlEmailBody >
<html>
<body>
<table border="0" width="550">
<c:InsperityEmailHeader />
<p>{!relatedTo.NSP_AIMS_Client_Name__c} ({!relatedTo.NSP_AIMS_ClientNo__c}) has commission-only employees. You will need to get approval from Insperity’s FLSA department.
 Please fill out the attached questionnaire and save as a Word document. </p>
 
 <p>When complete, forward to <a href="mailto:FLSA_specialists@insperity.com">FLSA_specialists@insperity.com</a> or fax to (800) 547-6783. 
If the employees are not commission only then you will need to update the Schedule A to
 reflect Salary or Hourly and notify Pricing and Review of the corrected version number.</p>
 
 
 


<p>Regards,<br/>
{!relatedTo.NSP_Project_Manager__r.Name}<br/>
{!relatedTo.NSP_Project_Manager__r.NSP_Job_Title__c}<br/>
{!relatedTo.NSP_Project_Manager__r.NSP_Work_email__c}</p>
<c:InsperityEmailFooter />
</table>
</body>
</html>
</messaging:HtmlEmailBody>
</messaging:emailTemplate>